    "text": "Share:\nLHS film screening\nLHS film screening, 10:30 a.m., 2, 5, & 7:30 p.m., Margaret H. Rollins Community Center, 101 Adams Ave., Lewes. “Bear Me into Freedom: Frederick Douglass and the Struggle for America’s Promise,” suggested donation $10, registration required. To register go to historiclewes.org/tours.\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 02/28/2026 - 10:30am",
